  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlgebraically convert the equation from part \u003cb\u003ea\u003c/b\u003e into point–slope form, and then graph it on your calculator. Also, enter the coordinates of the four points you found in parts \u003cb\u003ea\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003eb \u003c/b\u003ein L\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e and L\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e, and plot the points on the graph. 2.2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 3.1\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 0.5\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eStarting with 2.2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 3.1\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 0.5, subtract 2.2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e from both sides.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eStarting with 2.2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 3.1\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 0.5, subtract 2.2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e from both sides.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"129\" height\u003d\"21\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_7c_90/image014.gif\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eDivide through by –3.1.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eDivide through by –3.1.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"99\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_7c_90/image015.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSince we\u0027re using a calculator, we don\u0027t really need to simplify.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the function.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21339\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21339\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e and enter the function as Y\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e. Key in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21340\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qopenparen.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21340\u0026quot;,196)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21341\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21342\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdot.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21342\u0026quot;,135)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21343\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21344\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdivide.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21344\u0026quot;,133)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21345\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21346\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdot.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21346\u0026quot;,135)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21347\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21348\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qcloseparen.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21348\u0026quot;,121)\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u